{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15156","headline":"喜入兰陵望紫阁峯呈宣上人 · 李益","name":"喜入兰陵望紫阁峯呈宣上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薙草开三径，巢林喜一枝。\n地宽留种竹，泉浅欲开池。\n紫阁当疎牖，青松入坏篱。\n从今安僻陋，萧相是吾师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}